What KubeOS builds and ships
----------------------------

The ISO contains three kinds of software, and their notices travel with them:

  * this project's own work - the build hooks, the first-boot scripts and the helper
    commands, licensed Apache-2.0 under LICENSE;
  * the KubeOS dashboard (Headlamp plus the KubeOS gateway, console and plugin) - its
    own notices are installed on every node in /usr/share/doc/kubeos-dashboard/ when
    the dashboard is installed;
  * Debian packages, and the control-plane binaries vendored into the image. Those carry
    their own copyright files: /usr/share/doc/*/copyright for packages, and
    /usr/share/doc/kubeos-control-plane/ for the vendored Kubernetes and etcd binaries.

See docs/LICENSES.md for the full list, and for where the source code of every component
can be obtained.
